title: "bounty-economics"
abstract: >-
  A framework for reading a bug-bounty program's terms before hunting: five payout-tier shapes,
  fourteen exclusion-clause classes, a prior-audit surface checklist, and a JSON Schema plus
  validator for a researcher's own private ledger. Ships methodology, not program data.
